{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a67689d5-615f-8803-9821-87faaa240fa8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T10:17:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:14:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Nicholas Conti. I am calling about a storm drain, on the corner near my home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 210 Rhode Island Avenue, in the Historic Hill. The drain is on the corner, just down from the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on one moment, please. I am vacuuming in the other room, I must switch it off to hear you better. [pause] Okay, that is better. So, the drain is full to the top with water. It is not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is that left over from the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, from the coastal storm that ended Saturday, two days ago. The rain is long gone, but the water is still sitting there. On the other hand, the street is not flat, so now it is moving along the curb toward my neighbor's garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has it gotten into the garage yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, no. It is maybe two meters from the door. On the other hand, it is a slow stream, so I do not know how long until it arrives."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is the drain covered with leaves or debris, do you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are some leaves on the grate, yes, but the water is up level with the top. I think the problem is underneath. On the other hand, I am not an expert, so I cannot say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I'll put in a work order for a crew to go look at that catch basin. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:16:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It is 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:16:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166. And that's Nicholas Conti, 210 Rhode Island Avenue, corner drain full and backing toward a neighbor's garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly right. So I did the correct thing by calling you? I was not sure who to call to have it checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You did, this is the right department. Crews have a lot of drains to get to after a storm like that, but I'm marking this one as water heading toward a building, so it'll get looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is good to hear. And if the water reaches the garage before they come, should I call again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call right back and tell whoever answers it's reached the building. If it's after hours, the police non-emergency line can get someone out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:17:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I will tell my neighbor also. On the other hand, perhaps he already knows, but I will tell him anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you very much for your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Conti. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
